1
00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:15,770
Hello!

2
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,540
"English Grammar Workout: 700+ Tough Drills"

3
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,850
You find what you were looking for?

4
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:37,940
No. Maybe I should just order it in...

5
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,900
You could ask a clerk to help.

6
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:43,270
Nah, I'll just keep looking for it!

7
00:00:43,270 --> 00:00:45,560
Mmkay, I'm gonna grab this.

8
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:49,980
Oh, I'll come with you.
I'm gonna buy something, too.

9
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,650
Ow!

10
00:01:05,650 --> 00:01:10,650
They've got some game magazines
over there! Lemme show you, c'mon!

11
00:01:13,730 --> 00:01:15,520
Sure.

12
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:38,740
Horimiya

13
00:02:45,810 --> 00:02:48,060
Toru!

14
00:02:48,060 --> 00:02:51,020
What? You taking out the trash?

15
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:53,690
Yup. You grab the burnables.

16
00:02:53,690 --> 00:02:57,020
So I'm helping you now? Whoa!

17
00:02:57,020 --> 00:03:00,560
This one's heavy as shit! I see what
you're doing, Yoshikawa. Real smooth.

18
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,980
Huh? What could you possibly be talking about?

19
00:03:02,990 --> 00:03:05,830
You're Here, I'm Here

20
00:03:05,940 --> 00:03:10,230
Oh, right! That DVD I wanted is out today.

21
00:03:10,230 --> 00:03:11,560
Come with me to pick it up later.

22
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:13,060
Urgh...

23
00:03:13,060 --> 00:03:15,600
I'll let you borrow it later!

24
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:18,850
The actor playing the shopkeeper is so hot!

25
00:03:18,850 --> 00:03:25,100
And not just that...

26
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:22,310
Ever since Hori and Miyamura started dating,

27
00:03:22,310 --> 00:03:25,100
Yoshikawa's been giving me lots of attention.

28
00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:26,190
Are you even listening to me right now?

29
00:03:26,190 --> 00:03:27,980
I <i>am</i> , thank you!

30
00:03:27,980 --> 00:03:30,400
Ugh, you're so annoy--

31
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:38,900
Kono- <i>san</i> !

32
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:41,400
You okay?! I'm so sorry!

33
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:44,690
No, I was the one who ran into <i>you</i> .

34
00:03:44,690 --> 00:03:46,310
How embarrassing.

35
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:48,600
Hold on a sec!

36
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:50,020
I'll be right back!

37
00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:52,770
Oh, okay.

38
00:03:54,650 --> 00:03:57,100
Sorry! We gotta watch where we're going.

39
00:03:57,100 --> 00:03:59,060
No, you're fine.

40
00:03:59,060 --> 00:04:03,690
I really hope it doesn't leave a stain.

41
00:04:04,850 --> 00:04:06,940
Hey, Yoshikawa- <i>san</i> ...

42
00:04:08,270 --> 00:04:12,270
A-Are you dating Ishikawa- <i>kun</i> ?

43
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:16,900
No, we're not dating.

44
00:04:16,900 --> 00:04:18,900
Oh.

45
00:04:24,980 --> 00:04:28,940
I wasn't sure if you'd be able
to wear that home, Kono- <i>san</i> .

46
00:04:28,940 --> 00:04:32,940
And I figured Yoshikawa's
is probably too small...

47
00:04:32,660 --> 00:04:35,670
Ishikawa

48
00:04:32,940 --> 00:04:38,100
Mine's gonna be big, but at least
it's something. Sorry again!

49
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:41,400
Huh?! You want me to wear this?

50
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:44,810
Oh, crap, I should've just brought you yours!

51
00:04:44,810 --> 00:04:49,150
No! I'll borrow yours! Thank you!

52
00:04:49,930 --> 00:04:52,430
Student Council Room

53
00:04:55,440 --> 00:04:59,400
What's with the jacket?

54
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:01,690
It's a long story.

55
00:05:01,690 --> 00:05:02,810
Where's Remi?

56
00:05:02,810 --> 00:05:06,520
Oh, she had to head home
to take care of some stuff.

57
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,600
She did open the window, though.

58
00:05:10,650 --> 00:05:14,020
She's keeping on top of her window duty, huh.

59
00:05:15,100 --> 00:05:19,770
Hey, Sengoku- <i>kun</i> .
What is it that you like about her?

60
00:05:21,020 --> 00:05:23,730
I can't believe <i>you're</i> asking me that, too.

61
00:05:23,730 --> 00:05:26,810
I-Is it <i>that</i> shocking for me to ask?!

62
00:05:26,810 --> 00:05:28,940
Sorry, sorry.

63
00:05:36,190 --> 00:05:42,060
I guess the fact that she's not
very strong, so she needs me around.

64
00:05:42,060 --> 00:05:46,150
So you want someone weak to stand
next to you to make <i>you</i> look strong?

65
00:05:46,150 --> 00:05:52,230
No, that's not it! I don't control her,
just, like, I want to <i>protect</i> her!

66
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:56,480
She makes me want to protect her.

67
00:05:56,480 --> 00:06:02,020
But that's kind of what I like about her.

68
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:04,900
I'm not even that strong in the first place.

69
00:06:04,900 --> 00:06:10,400
But Remi makes me want to
be stronger, if just for her sake.

70
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:12,770
Because she's behind me, pushing me forward,

71
00:06:12,770 --> 00:06:19,560
I have the strength to give
her the push she needs, too.

72
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:23,730
In the end, she's protecting me.

73
00:06:23,730 --> 00:06:27,270
Just like how she protects you, right, Sakura?

74
00:06:30,690 --> 00:06:33,600
You look really cute, Sakura!

75
00:06:36,810 --> 00:06:40,650
Yeah, she does.

76
00:06:40,650 --> 00:06:44,440
She gives me courage.

77
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:56,190
Courage to try just a little bit harder.

78
00:06:58,810 --> 00:07:01,020
Ishikawa- <i>kun</i> ?

79
00:07:01,020 --> 00:07:04,100
Oh, hey, Kono- <i>san</i> .

80
00:07:04,100 --> 00:07:06,730
Thank you for lending me this.

81
00:07:06,730 --> 00:07:10,560
Sorry it took me so long to give
it back. I wanted to wash it first.

82
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:14,850
