94
00:07:55,730 --> 00:07:58,730
<i>Sakura</i> ? Yeah, I love <i>sakura</i> .

95
00:07:58,730 --> 00:07:59,850
Ishikawa!

96
00:07:59,850 --> 00:08:01,520
