131
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:52,350
It doesn't have to be fancy.
I just want it to taste good.

132
00:10:52,350 --> 00:10:55,810
Guess that's kind of hard, though.

133
00:10:55,810 --> 00:11:01,400
You know, Yoshikawa- <i>san</i> ,
