288
00:17:05,580 --> 00:17:08,080
Student Council Room

289
00:17:06,020 --> 00:17:08,270
What doesn't he like?

290
00:17:08,270 --> 00:17:11,270
Miyamura doesn't like horror movies.

291
00:17:11,270 --> 00:17:15,980
But he'll still watch them with me,
so maybe he does like 'em after all.

292
00:17:15,980 --> 00:17:17,770
Because you're making him watch them.

293
00:17:17,770 --> 00:17:19,400
Hey, Hori,

294
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:22,770
you're gonna push him away if you
keep watching all that scary stuff.

295
00:17:22,770 --> 00:17:24,270
You think so?

296
00:17:24,270 --> 00:17:28,940
A cute girl gleefully watching
slasher flicks is pretty creepy...

297
00:17:28,940 --> 00:17:32,350
C'mon now, I'm not <i>that</i> cute.

298
00:17:32,350 --> 00:17:35,270
That wasn't the point there, Hori.

299
00:17:35,270 --> 00:17:40,350
I agree with Yoshikawa! It's a total turnoff.

300
00:17:40,350 --> 00:17:42,940
Y-You think so?

301
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:49,480
I borrowed this for us, Hori- <i>san</i> .

302
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:52,100
It has lots of dogs in it!

303
00:17:52,100 --> 00:17:54,770
Can we watch <i>Right Behind You:</i>
<i>The Third Nightmare</i> instead?

304
00:17:54,770 --> 00:17:56,480
Sure.

305
00:17:59,150 --> 00:18:04,270
You're gonna push him away if you
keep watching all that scary stuff.

306
00:18:04,270 --> 00:18:08,770
Miyamura, so, uh, this movie's, uh...

307
00:18:08,770 --> 00:18:10,520
...gonna be pretty scary, huh?

308
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:11,980
What're you talking about?

309
00:18:11,980 --> 00:18:16,150
Compared to the PG-13 gorefests we always watch,

310
00:18:16,150 --> 00:18:17,730
this G-rated one's totally harmless!

311
00:18:17,730 --> 00:18:19,730
Yuki!

312
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:25,270
You should pretend to be scared!

313
00:18:25,270 --> 00:18:27,980
I'm scared!

314
00:18:27,980 --> 00:18:29,560
You scared me...

315
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:31,940
Ayasaki- <i>san</i> !

316
00:18:31,940 --> 00:18:34,310
Maybe this just won't work...

317
00:18:34,310 --> 00:18:37,190
Maybe you could hold his hand?

318
00:18:39,150 --> 00:18:41,850
Wow, I'm so scared...

319
00:18:46,770 --> 00:18:50,020
I just want to have fun
watching a movie with him...

320
00:18:50,020 --> 00:18:52,900
I'm sorry I'm such a scaredy-cat. I'm so sorry.

321
00:18:52,900 --> 00:18:57,480
N-No, don't apologize!
It's not your fault, Miyamura.

322
00:18:57,480 --> 00:19:02,020
I know. Give me a second, I need a moment alone.

323
00:19:02,020 --> 00:19:05,400
He's totally done with me...

324
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:08,150
It's over!

325
00:19:08,150 --> 00:19:10,690
I'm so lame.

326
00:19:10,690 --> 00:19:12,440
Hori- <i>san</i> ?

327
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:18,020
Hori- <i>san</i> ?

328
00:19:20,270 --> 00:19:23,440
I'm not cute at all.

329
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:26,310
Huh? What do you mean? You're really cute.

330
00:19:26,310 --> 00:19:28,600
I don't get scared. I can't even <i>act</i> scared.

331
00:19:28,600 --> 00:19:31,730
I can't do anything cute. I'm hopeless.

332
00:19:32,850 --> 00:19:37,060
Wait, were you doing all that for me?

333
00:19:37,060 --> 00:19:39,150
Who cares, you big dummy?!

334
00:19:39,150 --> 00:19:44,350
I'm sorry, Hori- <i>san</i> . I was too
freaked-out and scared to notice.

335
00:19:44,350 --> 00:19:47,810
Why do <i>you</i> keep apologizing to <i>me</i> ?!

336
00:19:47,810 --> 00:19:49,350
Don't look at me, dummy!

337
00:19:49,350 --> 00:19:52,150
You're the big dummy here, Hori- <i>san</i> .

338
00:19:52,150 --> 00:19:57,730
I didn't fall in love with
a "normal girl." I fell for <i>you</i> .

339
00:19:57,730 --> 00:20:01,520
Let's go watch the rest of the movie.

340
00:20:04,520 --> 00:20:06,940
It's raining pretty hard.

341
00:20:06,940 --> 00:20:09,020
Yeah, wow.

342
00:20:10,230 --> 00:20:12,560
I did, too.

343
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:15,020
I fell for <i>him</i> .

344
00:20:15,020 --> 00:20:19,400
His long eyelashes, his scaredy-cat jumps,

345
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:24,480
his sarcastic quips,
how thin he feels in my arms.

346
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:28,480
His voice, and... and...

347
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:30,230
Izumi.

348
00:20:43,730 --> 00:20:45,770
What's up?

349
00:20:45,770 --> 00:20:48,730
I'm listening to your heart.

350
00:20:53,730 --> 00:20:57,150
What's it saying?

351
00:20:57,150 --> 00:20:59,850
How cold it is.

352
00:21:04,020 --> 00:21:07,520
Your hands and ears are really cold, Miyamura.

353
00:21:07,520 --> 00:21:09,940
Probably from the rain.

354
00:21:09,940 --> 00:21:11,770
Could be.

355
00:21:11,770 --> 00:21:15,810
You can't go home in this downpour.

356
00:21:16,850 --> 00:21:19,020
There was a heat within me,

357
00:21:19,020 --> 00:21:22,730
and I wanted Miyamura to feel it, too.

358
00:21:27,150 --> 00:21:29,690
Look, it's you, me, and my big sis!

359
00:21:32,560 --> 00:21:33,900
Sota?

360
00:21:33,900 --> 00:21:38,020
You know, she's... <i>my</i> big sister.

361
00:21:39,690 --> 00:21:44,310
Are you worried I'll take her away from you?

362
00:21:45,310 --> 00:21:49,600
I won't. She's <i>your</i> big sister, Sota.

363
00:21:49,600 --> 00:21:50,850
And you're my bro?

364
00:21:50,850 --> 00:21:54,560
Yeah. I'm your big bro.

365
00:21:54,560 --> 00:21:57,690
I won't take your big sister away, Sota.

366
00:21:57,690 --> 00:22:01,150
But could I have Kyoko?

367
00:22:01,150 --> 00:22:03,020
Okay.

368
00:23:30,630 --> 00:23:34,050
The Truth Deception Reveals

369
00:23:34,520 --> 00:23:36,100
Ow, ow...

370
00:23:36,100 --> 00:23:38,150
Your hair's getting longer.

371
00:23:38,150 --> 00:23:42,900
If you cut it again, everyone'll see that mark.

372
00:23:42,900 --> 00:23:44,850
Why'd she bite you?

373
00:23:44,850 --> 00:23:47,480
I have no idea.

374
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:51,850
Looks like a mark of ownership,
but maybe I shouldn't tell him that.

